UniSHARP - LichtFeld Studio plugin

This plugin vendors source from Insta360-Research-Team/UniSHARP under ./unisharp/
and scripts/infer_unisharp.py. The upstream MIT license is included in
LICENSE-UniSHARP. Refer to the upstream repository for third-party
acknowledgements:

  https://github.com/Insta360-Research-Team/UniSHARP

The UniSHARP checkpoint is downloaded at runtime from the Hugging Face repository
Insta360-Research/Unisharp into ./models/ and is not redistributed here.

At runtime, the plugin may clone these source dependencies into plugin-local
ignored directories:

  UniK3D: https://github.com/lpiccinelli-eth/UniK3D
  3DGEER: https://github.com/boschresearch/3dgeer
